# The image takes requirements.txt, the code (engine/, server/, check.py, run.py) and the pages' sources (server/web/,
# built in the image's first stage). Never the tests, the docs, vault/ nor .env: no secret goes to a build.
*
!requirements.txt
!engine/
!server/
!check.py
!run.py
**/__pycache__
server/web/node_modules/
server/web/dist/
